==Description==
The '''JellyBeans Nametag''' is a nametag added as part of the [[Ducky Revenge Event]]. It was originally meant to be obtainable from it, though that never happened, leaving it unused in-game.

The '''JellyBeans Nametag''' has a purple gradient text with a dark purple outline. There is a purple wave behind the text. Multiple colorful jelly beans fall out of the nametag.

